    {
     "id": "cp-zh",
     "type": "text",
     "x": 40,
     "y": 406,
     "w": 580,
     "h": 40,
     "valign": "top",
     "fill": null,
     "lineColor": null,
     "paras": [
      {
       "align": "left",
       "runs": [
        {
         "text": "框選只要碰到就算，不必整個框進去。",
         "sizePt": 11,
         "bold": false,
         "color": "666666"
        }
       ]
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "id": "cp-en",
     "type": "text",
     "x": 660,
     "y": 406,
     "w": 580,
     "h": 40,
     "valign": "top",
     "fill": null,
     "lineColor": null,
     "paras": [
      {
       "align": "left",
       "runs": [
        {
         "text": "(caption — to translate)",
         "sizePt": 11,
         "bold": false,
         "color": "AAAAAA"
        }
       ]
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "id": "pr-vy6413",
     "type": "text",
     "x": 40,
     "y": 452,
     "w": 580,
     "h": 248,
     "valign": "top",
     "fill": null,
     "lineColor": null,
     "paras": [
      {
       "align": "left",
       "bullet": {
        "type": "char",
        "level": 0,
        "code": "2022"
       },
       "spaceAfter": 4,
       "runs": [
        {
         "text": "選一個",
         "sizePt": 10,
         "color": "1A1A1A",
         "bold": true
        },
        {
         "text": "：點它就好。拖曳搬移（靠近投影片中線與邊界時會磁性吸附住），四角與四邊中點共八個把手縮放，方向鍵微調（按住 ",
         "sizePt": 10,
         "color": "1A1A1A"
        },
        {
         "text": "Shift",
         "sizePt": 10,
         "color": "1A1A1A"
        },
        {
         "text": " 一次走 10px），",
         "sizePt": 10,
         "color": "1A1A1A"
        },
        {
         "text": "Delete",
         "sizePt": 10,
         "color": "1A1A1A"
        },
        {
         "text": " 刪除，",
         "sizePt": 10,
         "color": "1A1A1A"
        },
        {
         "text": "Cmd/Ctrl+D",
         "sizePt": 10,
         "color": "1A1A1A"
        },
        {
         "text": " 複製一份。",
         "sizePt": 10,
         "color": "1A1A1A"
        }
       ]
      },
      {
       "align": "left",
       "bullet": {
        "type": "char",
        "level": 0,
        "code": "2022"
       },
       "spaceAfter": 4,
       "runs": [
        {
         "text": "選很多個",
         "sizePt": 10,
         "color": "1A1A1A",
         "bold": true
        },
        {
         "text": "：",
         "sizePt": 10,
         "color": "1A1A1A"
        },
        {
         "text": "Shift",
         "sizePt": 10,
         "color": "1A1A1A"
        },
        {
         "text": " 或 Cmd 點擊加選減選，或在空白處拖曳",
         "sizePt": 10,
         "color": "1A1A1A"
        },
        {
         "text": "框選",
         "sizePt": 10,
         "color": "1A1A1A",
         "bold": true
        },
        {
         "text": "——框到的都選起來。",
         "sizePt": 10,
         "color": "1A1A1A"
        }
       ]
      },
      {
       "align": "left",
       "bullet": {
        "type": "char",
        "level": 0,
        "code": "2022"
       },
       "spaceAfter": 4,
       "runs": [
        {
         "text": "多選之後，拖",
         "sizePt": 10,
         "color": "1A1A1A"
        },
        {
         "text": "四角",
         "sizePt": 10,
         "color": "1A1A1A",
         "bold": true
        },
        {
         "text": "是整組等比縮放，位置、尺寸與字級一起跟著變；拖本體是整組搬移。右欄可以直接填縮放百分比，也可以對齊。",
         "sizePt": 10,
         "color": "1A1A1A"
        }
       ]
      },
      {
       "align": "left",
       "bullet": {
        "type": "char",
        "level": 0,
        "code": "2022"
       },
       "spaceAfter": 4,
       "runs": [
        {
         "text": "物件拖到投影片外面不會消失，會",
         "sizePt": 10,
         "color": "1A1A1A"
        },
        {
         "text": "半透明留在那裡",
         "sizePt": 10,
         "color": "1A1A1A",
         "bold": true
        },
        {
         "text": "，隨時拖得回來。那塊只是暫放區，匯出時照座標輸出，並且會給你一則",
         "sizePt": 10,
         "color": "1A1A1A"
        },
        {
         "text": "超出投影片",
         "sizePt": 10,
         "color": "1A1A1A",
         "bold": true
        },
        {
         "text": "的警告。",
         "sizePt": 10,
         "color": "1A1A1A"
        }
       ]
      },
      {
       "align": "left",
       "bullet": {
        "type": "char",
        "level": 0,
        "code": "2022"
       },
       "spaceAfter": 4,
       "runs": [
        {
         "text": "除了表格，所有元素都有一圈",
         "sizePt": 10,
         "color": "1A1A1A"
        },
        {
         "text": "淡虛線",
         "sizePt": 10,
         "color": "1A1A1A",
         "bold": true
        },
        {
         "text": "顯示框的實際大小——文字框沒填色時特別需要，不然你不知道它有多大。",
         "sizePt": 10,
         "color": "1A1A1A"
        }
       ]
      },
      {
       "align": "left",
       "bullet": {
        "type": "char",
        "level": 0,
        "code": "2022"
       },
       "spaceAfter": 4,
       "runs": [
        {
         "text": "復原與重做：",
         "sizePt": 10,
         "color": "1A1A1A"
        },
        {
         "text": "Cmd/Ctrl+Z",
         "sizePt": 10,
         "color": "1A1A1A"
        },
        {
         "text": " 與 ",
         "sizePt": 10,
         "color": "1A1A1A"
        },
        {
         "text": "Cmd/Ctrl+Shift+Z",
         "sizePt": 10,
         "color": "1A1A1A"
        },
        {
         "text": "，共 60 步。",
         "sizePt": 10,
         "color": "1A1A1A"
        }
       ]
      }
     ]
    },
