       "runs": [
        {
         "text": "雙擊",
         "sizePt": 10,
         "color": "1A1A1A",
         "bold": true
        },
        {
         "text": "文字框或形狀就開始改字，粗體、顏色、高亮",
         "sizePt": 10,
         "color": "1A1A1A"
        },
        {
         "text": "看得見也改得動",
         "sizePt": 10,
         "color": "1A1A1A",
         "bold": true
        },
        {
         "text": "。雙擊表格儲存格是改內容，雙擊圖表是改 option。",
         "sizePt": 10,
         "color": "1A1A1A"
        }
       ]
      },
      {
       "align": "left",
       "bullet": {
        "type": "char",
        "level": 0,
        "code": "2022"
       },
       "spaceAfter": 4,
       "runs": [
        {
         "text": "反白幾個字，右欄的格式按鈕就只套那幾個字",
         "sizePt": 10,
         "color": "1A1A1A",
         "bold": true
        },
        {
         "text": "；沒反白就是整個文字框。",
         "sizePt": 10,
         "color": "1A1A1A"
        }
       ]
      },
      {
       "align": "left",
       "bullet": {
        "type": "char",
        "level": 0,
