     "fill": null,
     "lineColor": null,
     "paras": [
      {
       "align": "left",
       "bullet": {
        "type": "char",
        "level": 0,
        "code": "2022"
       },
       "spaceAfter": 4,
       "runs": [
        {
         "text": "預設是",
         "sizePt": 10,
         "color": "AAAAAA"
        },
        {
         "text": "「完整」",
         "sizePt": 10,
         "color": "AAAAAA",
         "bold": true
        },
        {
         "text": "——整張塞進框裡，強制等比不變形。",
         "sizePt": 10,
         "color": "AAAAAA"
        }
       ]
      },
      {
       "align": "left",
       "bullet": {
        "type": "char",
        "level": 0,
        "code": "2022"
       },
       "spaceAfter": 4,
       "runs": [
        {
         "text": "雙擊圖片",
         "sizePt": 10,
         "color": "AAAAAA",
         "bold": true
        },
        {
         "text": "（或按「裁切…」）進入裁切模式：",
         "sizePt": 10,
         "color": "AAAAAA"
        },
        {
         "text": "拖曳",
         "sizePt": 10,
         "color": "AAAAAA",
         "bold": true
        },
        {
         "text": "移動構圖、",
         "sizePt": 10,
         "color": "AAAAAA"
        },
        {
         "text": "滾輪",
         "sizePt": 10,
         "color": "AAAAAA",
         "bold": true
        },
        {
         "text": "縮放、",
         "sizePt": 10,
         "color": "AAAAAA"
        },
        {
         "text": "Enter",
         "sizePt": 10,
         "color": "AAAAAA",
         "bold": true
        },
        {
         "text": " 完成。",
         "sizePt": 10,
         "color": "AAAAAA"
        }
       ]
      },
      {
       "align": "left",
       "bullet": {
        "type": "char",
        "level": 0,
        "code": "2022"
       },
       "spaceAfter": 4,
       "runs": [
        {
         "text": "被裁掉的部分",
         "sizePt": 10,
         "color": "AAAAAA"
        },
        {
         "text": "會變暗而不是消失",
         "sizePt": 10,
         "color": "AAAAAA",
         "bold": true
        },
        {
         "text": "，你看得到自己捨棄了什麼。",
         "sizePt": 10,
         "color": "AAAAAA"
        }
       ]
      },
      {
       "align": "left",
       "bullet": {
        "type": "char",
        "level": 0,
        "code": "2022"
       },
       "spaceAfter": 4,
       "runs": [
        {
         "text": "裁切模式下",
         "sizePt": 10,
         "color": "AAAAAA"
        },
        {
         "text": "拉外框只動裁切窗，圖片釘住不動",
         "sizePt": 10,
         "color": "AAAAAA",
         "bold": true
        },
        {
         "text": "，跟 PowerPoint 一致。",
         "sizePt": 10,
         "color": "AAAAAA"
        }
       ]
      },
      {
       "align": "left",
       "bullet": {
        "type": "char",
        "level": 0,
        "code": "2022"
       },
       "spaceAfter": 4,
       "runs": [
        {
         "text": "圖片",
         "sizePt": 10,
         "color": "AAAAAA"
        },
        {
         "text": "可以拖出框外做留白",
         "sizePt": 10,
         "color": "AAAAAA",
         "bold": true
        },
        {
         "text": "，用來裁出單邊或四周的空白。至少會保留一成的重疊，不會整片空白到找不到圖。",
         "sizePt": 10,
         "color": "AAAAAA"
        }
       ]
      },
      {
       "align": "left",
       "bullet": {
        "type": "char",
        "level": 0,
        "code": "2022"
       },
       "spaceAfter": 4,
       "runs": [
        {
         "text": "被裁掉的部分只是不顯示，原圖完整留在檔案裡",
         "sizePt": 10,
         "color": "AAAAAA",
         "bold": true
        },
        {
         "text": "，隨時可以按「完整」還原。另有",
         "sizePt": 10,
         "color": "AAAAAA"
        },
        {
         "text": "圓形裁切",
         "sizePt": 10,
         "color": "AAAAAA",
         "bold": true
        },
        {
         "text": "。",
         "sizePt": 10,
         "color": "AAAAAA"
        }
       ]
      },
      {
       "align": "left",
       "bullet": {
        "type": "char",
        "level": 0,
        "code": "2022"
       },
       "spaceAfter": 4,
       "runs": [
        {
         "text": "構圖存成四邊的比例，匯出為原生 ",
         "sizePt": 10,
         "color": "AAAAAA"
        },
        {
         "text": "srcRect",
         "sizePt": 10,
         "color": "AAAAAA",
         "fontFace": "Menlo"
        },
        {
         "text": "，在 PowerPoint 裡還可以再調。",
         "sizePt": 10,
         "color": "AAAAAA"
        }
       ]
      }
     ]
    }
   ]
  },
