    {
     "id": "pr-vka83h",
     "type": "text",
     "x": 40,
     "y": 452,
     "w": 580,
     "h": 248,
     "valign": "top",
     "fill": null,
     "lineColor": null,
     "paras": [
      {
       "align": "left",
       "bullet": {
        "type": "char",
        "level": 0,
        "code": "2022"
       },
       "spaceAfter": 4,
       "runs": [
        {
         "text": "雙擊進入儲存格，反白那幾個字，「儲存格樣式」的字級、粗體、斜體與文字色就只套在它們身上。取消反白就回到整格。",
         "sizePt": 10,
         "color": "1A1A1A"
        }
       ]
      },
      {
       "align": "left",
       "bullet": {
        "type": "char",
        "level": 0,
        "code": "2022"
       },
       "spaceAfter": 4,
       "runs": [
        {
         "text": "有反白時會多出一排「格內文字（反白處）」：上標、下標、底線、刪除線、高亮，還有把反白處退回整格樣式的「清除格式」。",
         "sizePt": 10,
         "color": "1A1A1A"
        }
       ]
      },
      {
       "align": "left",
       "bullet": {
        "type": "char",
        "level": 0,
        "code": "2022"
       },
       "spaceAfter": 4,
       "runs": [
        {
         "text": "上下標只有這條路",
         "sizePt": 10,
         "color": "1A1A1A",
         "bold": true
        },
        {
         "text": "：整格層級沒有上下標這兩個開關，化學式與科學記號都得從這排設。",
         "sizePt": 10,
         "color": "1A1A1A"
        }
       ]
      },
      {
       "align": "left",
       "bullet": {
        "type": "char",
        "level": 0,
        "code": "2022"
       },
       "spaceAfter": 4,
       "runs": [
        {
         "text": "格內編輯的按鍵",
         "sizePt": 10,
         "color": "1A1A1A",
         "bold": true
        },
        {
         "text": "：",
         "sizePt": 10,
         "color": "1A1A1A"
        },
        {
         "text": "Enter",
         "sizePt": 10,
         "color": "1A1A1A"
        },
        {
         "text": " 是在格子裡換行，跟 PowerPoint 一樣；",
         "sizePt": 10,
         "color": "1A1A1A"
        },
        {
         "text": "Esc",
         "sizePt": 10,
         "color": "1A1A1A"
        },
        {
         "text": " 結束編輯。",
         "sizePt": 10,
         "color": "1A1A1A"
        },
        {
         "text": "Tab",
         "sizePt": 10,
         "color": "1A1A1A"
        },
        {
         "text": " 不跳格，要換格請直接雙擊目標格。",
         "sizePt": 10,
         "color": "1A1A1A"
        }
       ]
      }
     ]
    },
